#: ../../administration/identity_sources/identity_sources.rst:9
msgid ""
"|morpheus| can integrate with many of the most common identity source "
"technologies, such as Active Directory, Okta, and many others. These can "
"be configured via the :guilabel:`Identity Sources` button on any Tenant "
"detail page (|AdmTen| > Selected Tenant) or on the Users list page "
"(|AdmUse|). These integrations map roles within these sign-on tools to "
"equivalent roles in |morpheus| so at first log in users are assigned the "
"appropriate role."
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| puede integrate con muchos de el la mayoría de common "
"identidad origen technologies, como Active Directory, Okta, y muchos "
"others. Estos se puede configurar a través de el :guilabel:`Identidad "
"Orígenes` botón en cualquier Inquilino detalle página (|AdmTen| > "
"Selected Inquilino) o en el Usuarios lista página (|AdmUse|). Estos "
"integraciones map roles dentro de estos sign-en tools a equivalent roles "
"en |morpheus| so en first log en usuarios son asignado el appropriate "
"rol."

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/active_directory.rst:2
msgid "Active Directory"
msgstr "Active Directory"

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/active_directory.rst:17
msgid ""
"Active Directory is Microsoft’s primary authentication service. It is "
"widely used in enterprise organizations and even in Microsoft cloud "
"services. While Active Directory also supports LDAP protocol support "
"(which |morpheus| can integrate with as well), |morpheus| includes a "
"dedicated identity integration type specifically for Active Directory. By"
" integrating Active Directory, |morpheus| administrators can fully "
"offload the work of managing the user lifecycle to Active Directory. "
"Creating new users, applying roles to users, updating basic user data, "
"disabling users, and more can be handled in Active Directory and "
"automatically filtered down to |morpheus|. This section includes an "
"example integration walkthrough as well as additional details on the "
"integration feature set."
msgstr ""
"Active Directory es Microsoft’s primary autenticación service. Es widely "
"usado en enterprise organizations y even en Microsoft cloud services. "
"While Active Directory también supports LDAP protocol soporte (que "
"|morpheus| puede integrate con as well), |morpheus| incluye a dedicated "
"identidad integración tipo specifically para Active Directory. Por "
"integrating Active Directory, |morpheus| administrators puede fully "
"offload el work de managing el usuario lifecycle a Active Directory. "
"Creando nuevo usuarios, applying roles a usuarios, updating basic usuario"
" data, disabling usuarios, y más puede ser handled en Active Directory y "
"automáticamente filtered down a |morpheus|. Este sección incluye un "
"ejemplo integración walkthrough así como adicional detalles en el "
"integración característica establecido."

