#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/onelogin.rst:29
msgid ""
"Select :guilabel:`SAVE CHANGES` and the OneLogin Integration will be "
"added."
msgstr ""
"Seleccionar :guilabel:`SAVE CHANGES` y el OneLogin Integración será "
