#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/onelogin.rst:31
msgid ""
"Users can now login to |morpheus| with OneLogin credentials. The first "
"login will create a user in |morpheus| matching the username, email and "
"password from OneLogin. If a REQUIRED ROLE is specified in the Identity "
"Source settings, only users with that Role in OneLogin will be able to "
"login to |morpheus|."
msgstr ""
"Usuarios puede now inicio de sesión a |morpheus| con OneLogin "
"credenciales. El first inicio de sesión va a crear a usuario en "
"|morpheus| matching el usuarioname, correo electrónico y contraseña desde"
" OneLogin. Si a REQUIRED ROLE es specified en el Identidad Origen "
"configuración, solo usuarios con ese Rol en OneLogin será able a inicio "
"de sesión a |morpheus|."

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/onelogin.rst:33
msgid ""
"OneLogin users will not authenticate in |morpheus| if there is an "
"existing |morpheus| User with matching username or email address."
msgstr ""
"OneLogin usuarios no authenticate en |morpheus| si there es un existente "
"|morpheus| Usuario con matching usuarioname o correo electrónico address."

#: ../../integration_guides/IdentityManagement/onelogin.rst:35
msgid ""
"You can now test the integration by logging in with user credentials "
"which have been configured in OneLogin. On the first login, a new user "
"will be created with the same username, email address, and password as "
"contained in OneLogin. On subsequent logins, |morpheus| will sync with "
"OneLogin to make sure the user hasn't been disabled or if its Role(s) "
"have changed in OneLogin which would affect its corresponding Roles in "
"|morpheus|."
msgstr ""
"You puede now test el integración por logging en con usuario credenciales"
" que han sido configurado en OneLogin. En el first inicio de sesión, a "
"nuevo usuario será creado con el mismo usuarioname, correo electrónico "
"address, y contraseña as contained en OneLogin. En subsequent logins, "
"|morpheus| va a sync con OneLogin a make sure el usuario hasn't been "
"deshabilitado o si su Rol(s) tienen changed en OneLogin que would affect "
"su corresponding Roles en |morpheus|."

